; load postprocess_rad -> pp_eff_name. Point that at our no-op
; (unique name so GAMMA Postprocess radiation.ppe cannot win).
; Engine fatals if noise.grain <= 0; intensity 0 is the no-op.
; Delete zone postprocess so C++ never builds CZoneEffector.
; radius 0 is backup if a leftover key still Creates one.
; Missing-section ![] is a warning, not a fatal (Xr_ini.cpp).

